      D2 — Resume reason storage (AC-RESUME-REASON-*) — (b)
      ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
      Chosen: **child element** `<Reason>…text…</Reason>` on the resume event
      (loose file and folded ledger Event), not a root attribute.

      Why not attribute (despite verification-unavailable using attributes.reason):
        Operator replan prose is free text: quotes, `&`, `<>`, and newlines are
        normal. Attribute values are a narrower channel (whitespace normalization
        risk; exact toBe on multiline is fragile). Element text uses escapeText /
        parser decode the same path as other free-text children; fold verify's
        payloadFingerprint serializes children via serializeGraceXmlNode, so a
        Reason child is in the fingerprint without special-casing attributes.
        Spec authoring hit bare `&&` → xml.parse; that is the class of free-text
        hazard attributes make worse for multi-line reasons.

      Write path:
        resumeCursor(projectRoot, changeId, task, options?: { reason?: string })
        advanceCursor(..., { kind: "resume", reason?: string })
        Before write, if listUnresolvedEscalatedTasks includes task:
          require reason trimmed non-empty; else GraceCommandError invalid-arguments
          (stable message naming --reason); do not writeEventFile; set uncleared.
        If not escalated: reason optional; if provided, still record Reason child.
        writeEventFile with children: [{ tag: "Reason", attributes: {}, children: [],
          text: reason }] when reason present.

      CLI: ngrace cursor resume gains --reason (string). advance --kind resume must
      accept the same flag (wire both entry paths). Refuse path before write.

      Read / round-trip (AC-RESUME-REASON-RECORDED):
        After write, listLooseEvents finds Reason child text exact toBe.
        After fold, listLedgerEvents same exact toBe (decode after serialize).
        Counterweight: reason with `&`, quotes, and a newline survives fold toBe.

      Do not put reason only on stdout/message. Do not use attributes.reason for
      resume (avoid two homes). VU attribute reason is unchanged (NonGoal).

